    "ChatGPT %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT blocked the request for your account data. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT a bloqué la requête pour les données de ton compte. Réessaie plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT couldn't finish replying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT n'a pas pu terminer sa réponse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT didn't keep this change. Try again, or change it in ChatGPT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT n'a pas gardé ce changement. Réessaie, ou modifie-le dans ChatGPT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT didn't quite catch that. Try again and speak a little longer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT n'a pas bien compris. Réessaie en parlant un peu plus longtemps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT doesn't say how it treats your age": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT n'indique pas comment il considère ton âge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT estimates your age from the topics you talk about, the hours you use it and how old your account is. Verifying answers that guess with even more personal data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ChatGPT estime ton âge d'après les sujets que tu abordes, les heures où tu l'utilises et l'ancienneté de ton compte. Faire la vérification répond à cette supposition avec encore plus de données personnelles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT has the check done by Persona, a verification company. Depending on the country, it asks for a live selfie, a photo of a government ID, or both.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
