    "Notifications work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notifications fonctionnent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO %@ is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO %@ est disponible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO %@ is ready to install": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La version %@ est prête à être installée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO asks for %@ or your passcode when it opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO demande %@ ou ton code quand il s'ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO could not receive the sign-in response. Try signing in with a code instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO n'a pas pu recevoir la réponse de connexion. Essaie plutôt la connexion avec un code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO couldn't tell which plan your account has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO n'a pas pu déterminer le forfait de ton compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO covers your chats while the screen is recorded, mirrored or shared, and when it shows in the app switcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO masque tes chats pendant que l'écran est enregistré, recopié ou partagé, et quand il apparaît dans le sélecteur d'apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO follows the appearance of your device or stays light or dark, with ChatGPT's accent colors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO suit l'apparence de ton appareil ou reste clair ou sombre, avec les couleurs d'accentuation de ChatGPT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO is an independent open-source project, not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI. ChatGPT is a trademark of OpenAI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO est un projet open source indépendant, ni affilié ni approuvé par OpenAI. ChatGPT est une marque d'OpenAI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO is locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO est verrouillé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO is up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO est à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO looks for new versions on GitHub Releases.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO cherche les nouvelles versions sur GitHub Releases."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO never asks for your face or an ID, and never starts a verification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO ne te demande jamais ton visage ni une pièce d'identité, et ne lance jamais de vérification."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO sur GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO reads replies with the voices of your device, without sending anything. More voices can be downloaded in iOS Settings → Accessibility → Spoken Content.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO lit les réponses avec les voix de ton appareil, sans rien envoyer. D'autres voix se téléchargent dans Réglages → Accessibilité → Contenu énoncé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO shows no ads and doesn't track you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO n'affiche aucune publicité et ne te piste pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO shows the chats of your account, but its replies are generated through the Codex backend of your plan. The messages you write in OCTO stay on this device, and a note shows where they start in a chat from your account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO affiche les chats de ton compte, mais ses réponses sont générées par le backend Codex de ton forfait. Les messages que tu écris dans OCTO restent sur l'appareil, et une mention indique où ils commencent dans un chat de ton compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO tells you when a new version is out and installs it with AltStore or SideStore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO te prévient quand une nouvelle version sort et l'installe avec AltStore ou SideStore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OCTO tells you when a new version is published on GitHub. Install its IPA with AltStore, SideStore or Sideloadly over the current app: your chats and settings stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCTO te prévient quand une nouvelle version est publiée sur GitHub. Installe son IPA avec AltStore, SideStore ou Sideloadly par-dessus l'app actuelle : tes chats et tes réglages restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Occupation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profession"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur l'appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once verified, your account is linked to your face, your date of birth and your papers. Your chats, often very personal, no longer belong to an anonymous account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fois vérifié, ton compte est lié à ton visage, à ta date de naissance et à tes papiers. Tes chats, souvent très personnels, n'appartiennent plus à un compte anonyme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open ChatGPT settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les réglages de ChatGPT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open iOS Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les Réglages d'iOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir sur GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open page": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir la page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open sidebar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir la barre latérale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the page below on any device, sign in to ChatGPT and enter this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre la page ci-dessous sur n'importe quel appareil, connecte-toi à ChatGPT et saisis ce code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI Help Center": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Centre d'aide OpenAI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI is having trouble right now. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
