    "Speed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vitesse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Started in OCTO, kept on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commencés dans OCTO, gardés sur cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe a tab to take it out of the bar, or tap Edit to change their order. Home always stays: it's where you write to ChatGPT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balaie un onglet pour le retirer de la barre, ou touche Modifier pour changer leur ordre. Accueil reste toujours : c'est là que tu écris à ChatGPT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch between your accounts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passe d'un compte à l'autre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre d'onglets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bar holds up to 5 tabs. Take one out to add another.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La barre contient jusqu'à 5 onglets. Retires-en un pour en ajouter un autre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chat you're writing in. Always in the bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le chat dans lequel tu écris. Toujours dans la barre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chats of your ChatGPT account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les chats de ton compte ChatGPT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chats you start in OCTO are written with Codex and stay on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les chats que tu commences dans OCTO sont écrits avec Codex et restent sur cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The projects of your ChatGPT account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les projets de ton compte ChatGPT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search button sits apart, at the end of the bar, and looks through every chat — even inside the messages. While you scroll down a chat, the bar can shrink to leave it more room.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton de recherche se tient à part, au bout de la barre, et cherche dans tous les chats — même dans les messages. Quand tu fais défiler un chat vers le bas, la barre peut se réduire pour lui laisser plus de place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The usual speed and usage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La vitesse et la consommation habituelles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking: %@ to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réflexion : %1$@ à %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where chats come from": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provenance des chats"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written with Codex, on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrit avec Codex, sur cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're on the free plan. Codex still offers it several models: pick one at the top of a chat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu es sur le forfait gratuit. Codex lui propose quand même plusieurs modèles : choisis-en un en haut d'un chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're on the free plan: Codex answers with the model it offers your account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu es sur le forfait gratuit : Codex répond avec le modèle qu'il propose à ton compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ChatGPT projects will appear here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes projets ChatGPT apparaîtront ici"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your chats, Home and Settings sit in a Liquid Glass bar at the bottom of the screen. Choose its tabs below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes chats, l'accueil et les réglages se rangent dans une barre Liquid Glass en bas de l'écran. Choisis ses onglets ci-dessous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plan doesn't include this speed: ChatGPT is answering at the usual speed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton forfait n'inclut pas cette vitesse : ChatGPT répond à la vitesse habituelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultrafast": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ultra-rapide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Our most capable model for complex, demanding work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notre modèle le plus performant, pour le travail complexe et exigeant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest frontier agentic coding model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dernier modèle de pointe pour coder en mode agent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balanced agentic coding model for everyday work.": {
      "localizations": {
